01:24:33.389 --> 01:24:35.260
my own curiosity here.

01:24:35.260 --> 01:24:36.889
And there's a list here.

01:24:36.889 --> 01:24:49.060
So on the omegas, because we discussed omega-3
fatty acids, EPA/DHA, and I increased my intake.

01:24:49.060 --> 01:24:50.460
I'm so curious to know.

01:24:50.460 --> 01:24:57.659
Because I do observe, seemingly, a very consistent
