01:25:57.110 --> 01:25:58.110
And I'm like, "God."

01:25:58.110 --> 01:25:59.110
Andrew Huberman: So you know it's the fish
oil.

01:25:59.110 --> 01:26:00.110
Tim Ferriss: A bummer.

01:26:00.110 --> 01:26:01.110
Yeah.

01:26:01.110 --> 01:26:05.510
Andrew Huberman: There's obviously some great
