01:57:46.700 --> 01:57:48.830
But these are deeply wired systems.

01:57:48.830 --> 01:57:49.830
Tim Ferriss: Yeah.

01:57:49.830 --> 01:57:51.690
To they who have much, much will be given.

01:57:51.690 --> 01:57:52.690
Andrew Huberman: Yeah.

01:57:52.690 --> 01:57:55.829
So, for those of you willing to date and find
