02:35:38.890 --> 02:35:43.210
and things of that sort, transcripts are available
to those folks, to raise revenue for research

02:35:43.210 --> 02:35:44.540
dollars for exciting work.

02:35:44.540 --> 02:35:48.479
And we have a donor that's been very generous
to do a match for that money.

02:35:48.479 --> 02:35:53.319
And we're giving money only to studies working
