02:36:42.290 --> 02:36:50.040
hippie communities, carpet flyers, everything
from devil's weed craziness to truly effective

02:36:50.040 --> 02:36:55.260
compounds for treating psychiatric illness,
you're going to be on that list.

02:36:55.260 --> 02:36:56.810
Roland's going to be on that list.

02:36:56.810 --> 02:36:58.240
Matthew's going to be on that list.

02:36:58.240 --> 02:36:59.529
Pollan's going to be on that list.

02:36:59.529 --> 02:37:02.180
Robin's going to be on that list.

02:37:02.180 --> 02:37:03.930
And Nolan, I think, is going to be on that
list.

02:37:03.930 --> 02:37:07.640
There's going to be a small subset of people
that we're going to go, listen, research takes

02:37:07.640 --> 02:37:11.740
money, it takes focus, it takes a bravery,
and it also takes the willingness to take

02:37:11.740 --> 02:37:17.210
something that has been looked at as just
drugs, and turn it into something that's therapeutically

02:37:17.210 --> 02:37:18.210
meaningful.

02:37:18.210 --> 02:37:21.890
So yeah, we're just, all I'm trying to do
