02:38:03.220 --> 02:38:06.970
These compounds are going to bend the arc
of history in the right direction.

02:38:06.970 --> 02:38:12.050
And if people out there are listening and
saying, "Okay, well this is recreational stuff

02:38:12.050 --> 02:38:13.160
and it's very precarious."

02:38:13.160 --> 02:38:18.750
I do not know a single major, let's just call
